  partName: Right Front Clip (2)
  description: The Right Front Clip (2) is a small, thin-flat clip situated at the
    middle-right-front of the engine, constructed from Material.006, responsible
    for securing various components in place. This clip is vital for maintaining
    the structural integrity of the engine, and a notable aspect is that it is often
    overlooked during routine maintenance, despite its critical function. The Right
    Front Clip (2) works in conjunction with other clips to ensure proper engine
    operation.
